https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

It is adapted from the English Wikipedia articles "Visa requirements for X citizens"
by Wikipedia contributors, also licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0. Each row's source_url
links to the exact article revision it was taken from; the revision history of each
article lists its authors.

Changes made: rows were extracted from the articles' tables and normalized into
ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 codes, a fixed set of categories and a stay value with its unit.
